</div><!--]--></div><div class="hero__cta"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-primary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--><!--]--><div class="page__sections"><!--[-->
<section id="about" class="section-service" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-about;"><!--[--><div class="service-about u-bg-primary veneers-page__about"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block"><div class="scroll-block__overlay"></div><div class="scroll-block__content scroll-block-grid"><div class="scroll-block-grid__header"><div class="scroll-block-progress"><div class="scroll-block-progress__fill"></div></div><h2 class="scroll-block__title u-text-headings-medium">Everything you need to know about veneers</h2></div><div class="scroll-block-grid__body"><div class="scroll-block__items"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">What are they?</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Thin ceramic or porcelain shells crafted to fit perfectly over the front of your teeth.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Veneer thickness</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– They range from just 0.2 mm (non-prep options) to 0.4–0.6 mm for ceramic veneers.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Do not change colour and shape</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Veneers can last for 15–20 years.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Improved appearance</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Veneers can improve tooth position, hide crooked, uneven, and/or darkened teeth.</div></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-when u-bg-primary veneers-page__when"><div class="list-block list-block--visible"><div class="list-block__header u-bg-primary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><h2 class="list-block__title u-text-headings-large">When are veneers the best choice?</h2><div class="list-block__header-photos"><!--[--><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/00a89782fe3e-7.avif 1x, /assets/img/265d291cb476-7.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0s;" src="/assets/img/00a89782fe3e-7.avif"><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/fbc3cc92708d-8.avif 1x, /assets/img/72e16d0b1b43-8.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0.2s;" src="/assets/img/fbc3cc92708d-8.avif"><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="list-block__body u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><ul class="list-block__items"><!--[--><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.4s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">01</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Gaps between teeth</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Perfect for sorting out gaps between teeth that braces can’t correct.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.6000000000000001s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">02</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Tooth shade</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Ideal if any of your front teeth are deed, have darkened over time (perhaps due to a root canal) and you’d like to make them look as healthy as possible.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.8s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">03</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Uneven teeth</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Worn or damaged teeth that require aesthetic improvement.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:1s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">04</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Sensitive teeth &amp;amp; receding gums</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">A fantastic solution if you have severe tooth sensitivity or exposed roots that need protecting.</div></div></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[--><div class="service-benefits u-bg-primary veneers-page__benefits"><div class="wheel-block"><div class="wheel-block__sticky-content"><div class="wheel-block__header"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Why choose veneers?<!--]--></h2><!--]--></div></div><div class="wheel-block__body"><div class="wheel-block__body-inner"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="wheel-block-wheel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1202" height="1202" viewBox="0 0 1202 1202" fill="none" class="wheel-block-wheel__svg" style="--wheel-rotation-degrees-start:120deg;"><circle cx="600" cy="600" r="534.5" stroke="#DDEFDE" opacity=".2"></circle><!--[--><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(0 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">1</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(120 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">2</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(240 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">3</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><!--]--></svg><!--[--><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Digital smile design (DSD)</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">We map out your entire treatment digitally, meaning you get to preview your brand-new smile before we even touch a tooth.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">A smile designed specifically to match your facial features.</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">Based on the diagnostic data, an individual treatment plan is prepared. A 3D visualization allows you to see how veneers will change the appearance of your teeth, what the final result will look like, and how long the treatment process will take.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Modern Laboratory</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">Exclusive and highly individualised craftsmanship — veneers are created by highly qualified ceramists in our partner laboratory in Dubai.</p></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="wheel-block__triggers"><!--[--><div data-nr="1" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="2" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="3" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="service-price u-bg-primary veneers-page__price"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="callout u-bg-secondary apply-callout"><div class="callout__body"><!--[--><!--[--><h2 class="u-text-headings-small service-price__title">Comprehensive diagnostic price today</h2><p class="u-text-body-medium">After diagnostics, you will receive a personalised treatment plan that includes not only veneer planning, but also any additional procedures necessary to achieve your perfect smile.</p><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__aside"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="service-price__prices"><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--old u-text-headings-small">€650</span><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--new u-text-headings-medium">€280</span></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__cta"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-how u-bg-primary veneers-page__how"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="service-how-grid"><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->How is this done?<!--]--></h2></div><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--body"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-secondary service-how__progress"></div><div class="service-how__items"><!--[--><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/42705812e640-13.avif 1x, /assets/img/e034759051bc-13.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/42705812e640-13.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>1. First appointment — Examinations</h3>
<p>During the first visit, the dentist will carry out the necessary examinations:<br>
–  digital teeth scanning with a 3Shape scanner<br>
–  digital dental X-rays<br>
–  detailed examination of the oral cavity and teeth<br>
– professional facial photographs for smile analysis<br>
Based on this information, a personalised treatment plan will be created.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/aa924c13c740-14.avif 1x, /assets/img/fb10f3cc1783-14.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/aa924c13c740-14.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>2. Second visit — presentation of the treatment plan</h3>
<p>Based on the examinations performed during the first visit, a personalised treatment plan is prepared with treatment stages, clear costs, and timelines. The plan includes not only the veneer solution, but a complete treatment plan to achieve the perfect smile. The dentist digitally creates your future smile design (DSD).</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/1c3be6c42ab2-15.avif 1x, /assets/img/bbab34c3eef1-15.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/1c3be6c42ab2-15.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>3. Veneer fabrication</h3>
<p>The fabrication of veneers is an exclusive and highly individualised handcrafted process. Veneers are created by highly qualified ceramists (smile design specialists) in our partner laboratory in Dubai.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/680c28695ccd-16.avif 1x, /assets/img/c311c4e0e450-16.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/680c28695ccd-16.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>4. If your teeth and gums are completely healthy, you can get your perfect smile in little as 7 days!</h3>
<p>However, it usually depends on how many veneers you’re getting and appointment availability.</p>
<p>In practice, a complete smile transformation with veneers usually takes approximately 1–1.5 months and 4 visits.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--footer"><button class="button button--type-primary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></section>
<section id="portfolio" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-portfolio;"><!--[--><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section class="section-portfolio"><div class="portfolio-story u-bg-tertiary section-portfolio__story"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-story__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Our patient’s story on the way to the Perfect Smile<!--]--></h2></div><div class="portfolio-story__body"><div class="portfolio-story-box u-bg-secondary"><div class="portfolio-story-box__aside"><div class="video-dialog video-dialog--type-cover portfolio-story-box__preview"><video class="video-dialog__preview" width="640" height="1138" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" src="/cms/api/media/file/sales-story-tease.webm" autoplay=""></video><button aria-label="Play video" class="video-dialog__button"><div class="icon-button icon-button--type-primary icon-button--size-medium video-dialog__play-button"><div class="icon-button__icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 54 54"><path fill="currentColor" d="M22.031 19.687a1 1 0 0 1 1.515-.858l12.188 7.313a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.715L23.546 35.17a1 1 0 0 1-1.515-.857V19.687Z"></path></svg><!--]--></div></div></button><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></div></div><div class="portfolio-story-box__body"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><h3>Goal</h3>
<p>To improve the appearance of my smile, I was concerned about the existing composite coatings on the front teeth (fillings), which were worn, cracked, and discoloured.</p>
<h3>What we did</h3>
<ul>
<li>We performed comprehensive diagnostics – collecting the patient’s history, followed by oral cavity and teeth examination, 3 Shape scan, intraoral digital X-rays, KSDT (3D X-ray), photo protocol, facial analysis;</li>
<li>We prepared a personalised treatment plan, including all the required finances, implementation time, and also demonstrated a digital smile design, during which the patient was able to view before/after pictures of her smile before we started any treatment process.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Result</h3>
<p>Treatment duration 3 months:</p>
<ul>
<li>We replaced 2 missing teeth with Straumann implants,</li>
<li>We performed endodontic root canal treatment under microscope control, therapeutic treatment and smile reconstruction with 24 ceramic veneers, which were made in our technical laboratory in Dubai.</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples u-bg-tertiary section-portfolio__examples"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-examples__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Examples of our work<!--]--></h2></div><div class="portfolio-examples__body"><div class="portfolio-examples-list"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="69de4df1e58b9440b5090f8b"><div><div id="yoo391n02" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/Alberts1pēc-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/Alberts1pirms-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="29.5" fill="#031C14" stroke="#031C14"></circle>
      <path fill="none" stroke="#DDEFDE" stroke-width="2" d="M17 30.5h26m-26 0 4.645-4.5M17 30.5l4.645 4.5M43 30.5 38.355 26M43 30.5 38.355 35"></path>
    </svg>
  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h3><strong>Full smile reconstruction</strong></h3><p>In this clinical case, the patient came to us with a serious problem – he had only six teeth left in both the upper and lower jaws. He wanted not only to restore his teeth, but also to regain a full, harmonious and natural smile that would give him confidence and look truly inspiring.</p><h3><strong>Planning and functional reconstruction</strong></h3><p>Our team started treatment with a comprehensive approach – we carefully planned each stage of the treatment in order to restore both the patient's aesthetic appearance and full chewing function.&nbsp;</p><p>To replace his missing teeth, we inserted twelve Swiss <strong>Straumann</strong> implants – six in the upper and lower jaws in the lateral teeth areas. These implants provided a stable foundation for zirconia crowns.</p><h3><strong>Aesthetic art</strong></h3><p>On the patient's remaining teeth, we installed exclusive ceramic veneers hand-made by our cooperation partners – professional ceramic specialists in Dubai. Each veneer was custom-made to complement the patient's facial proportions, smile line and speech characteristics.</p><p>The ultra-thin ceramic layer of just 0.5&nbsp;mm made it possible to preserve natural translucency and light reflection, thus creating an outstanding aesthetic appearance with no plastic or artificial feeling.</p><h3><strong>Perfection in the details</strong></h3><p>Zirconia crowns on implants ensured the durability and longevity of the structure, while veneers gave the patient's smile a look of lightness, radiance and sophistication.&nbsp;</p><p>The whole treatment process – from insertion of implants through to final prosthetics – lasted seven months. The aesthetic stage with the production and installation of veneers took about four weeks.&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Result</strong></h3><p>The result is not just a new smile – it is a story of complete transformation. The patient acquired a healthy, harmonious and natural smile, which not only restored his chewing function, but also reflected his self-confidence, inner strength and improved quality of life.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="69de4e27e58b9440b5090f8d"><div><div id="yp1so764i" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/4pēc-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/4pirms-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="29.5" fill="#031C14" stroke="#031C14"></circle>
      <path fill="none" stroke="#DDEFDE" stroke-width="2" d="M17 30.5h26m-26 0 4.645-4.5M17 30.5l4.645 4.5M43 30.5 38.355 26M43 30.5 38.355 35"></path>
    </svg>
  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h2><strong>Complete smile reconstruction and renewed function of teeth</strong></h2><p>A patient came to our clinic who had spent over a decade living with metal-ceramic crowns on her front teeth and missing her lateral teeth. Over time, her crowns and gum area had become inflamed, while her missing lateral abutment teeth had altered her bite. This not only affected her chewing function, but the look of her smile and even her facial proportions.</p><h3><strong>Goal and treatment strategy</strong></h3><p>Our team's main goal was to comprehensively restore the health and functionality the patient's oral cavity and the beauty of her smile. We performed all the treatment at the LAVA Dental Studio, with the participation of six specialists during each stage, including an implantologist, surgeon, prosthodontist, therapist, endodontist and hygienist. This interdisciplinary approach enabled us to provide the patient with the most effective, orderly and comfortable treatment.</p><h3><strong>State-of-the-art technology and digital planning</strong></h3><p>Throughout the treatment process, we used the very latest high precision digital technology:<br>● intraoral 3D scanning,<br>● computed tomography,<br>● digital smile modelling.</p><p>This enabled us to plan each step carefully and show the expected result to the patient before treatment had even begun. This approach ensured a clear and transparent process, thus gave the patient complete confidence in the final solution.</p><h3><strong>Comprehensive restoration</strong></h3><p>After complete dental treatment and gum correction, we replaced the patient's missing teeth with Swiss-made <strong>Straumann</strong> implants. The final stage was the preparation and installation of natural ceramic crowns. These completely restored the patient's correct bite, the harmony of her smile, and natural facial lines, including the proportions of her lip rests and lower face.</p><h3><strong>Result&nbsp;</strong></h3><p>The entire process took 14 months and turned out to be a great example of how a combination of the very latest technologies and coordinated teamwork make it possible to achieve excellent results. As a result, the patient acquired not only a healthy and functional bite, but also new confidence, natural confidence and an aesthetically harmonious overall image.&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="69de4e7de58b9440b5090f8f"><div><div id="tidmg9r9e" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pēc-13-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pirms-13-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="29.5" fill="#031C14" stroke="#031C14"></circle>
      <path fill="none" stroke="#DDEFDE" stroke-width="2" d="M17 30.5h26m-26 0 4.645-4.5M17 30.5l4.645 4.5M43 30.5 38.355 26M43 30.5 38.355 35"></path>
    </svg>
  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h2><strong>Clinical case: harmonisation of tooth gaps and colours with ceramic veneers</strong></h2><p>The patient's teeth had been straightened with metal braces over five years ago. However, over the course of time, several gaps had developed between the teeth, while the colour and length of her teeth had become uneven, with some teeth appeared darker, while others were lighter, while some were longer or shorter. Naturally, these visual changes caused the patient distress and undermined her confidence in the appearance of her smile.</p><h3><strong>Treatment process</strong></h3><p>Our goal was to harmonise the appearance of the teeth and create an even, aesthetically pleasing smile <strong>in just three weeks</strong>.</p><ul class="list-bullet"><li class="" style="" value="1">Firstly, we performed <strong>digital smile planning</strong>, which enabled us to visualise the outcome precisely before treatment had even started.</li><li class="" style="" value="2">After planning, <strong>20 ceramic veneers</strong> were prepared for the patient's teeth in both her upper and lower jaws.</li></ul><h3><strong>Result</strong></h3><p>The patient acquired a natural, harmonious and aesthetically attractive smile perfectly matching her facial features and personality. The short treatment time and digital planning facilitated an exemplary outcome in a highly efficient and precise manner.</p></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples__footer"><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><!--]--></section><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section id="process" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-process;"><div class="process-team u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="process-team-block"><div class="process-team-block__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->First-time clients are received by<!--]--></h2></div><div class="process-team__body"><div class="process-team-member-grid"><!--[--><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(20vmin);--end-transform:translateY(-20vmin);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded process-team-member__image" alt="Dr_Aleksejevs" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Dr. Vladislavs Aleksejevs</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Clinic Head, Dentist</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">Dr. Vladislavs&nbsp;worked in the field of dentistry since 2014. A graduate of Riga Stradiņš University's Faculty of Dentistry,&nbsp;he studied inorganic chemistry at Harvard University.&nbsp;In 2018, he founded LAVA dental practice in Ludza. Two years later, in 2020, he founded LAVA dental studio in Riga.&nbsp;He specialises in aesthetic, digital dentistry and smile makeovers using veneers and&nbsp;regularly attends conferences and training courses in Latvia and abroad.&nbsp;You can find out more about Dr. Vladislavs' accomplishments in dentistry and everyday life on his Instagram page: @dr.aleksejevs</div></div></div><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(0);--end-transform:translateY(0);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Limonova_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Limonova_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded process-team-member__image" alt="Dr_Limonova" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Limonova_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Dr. Alisa Ļimonova</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Dentist, Therapist</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">Dr. Alisa has worked in the field of dentistry since 2015. A graduate of Riga Stradiņš University's Faculty of Dentistry.Specialises in endodontics (root canal treatment) and treats root canals of various complexity under microscope control. Regularly attends conferences and training courses both in Latvia and abroad.</div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="process-team-block"><div class="process-team-block__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Our coordinators will take care of the treatment process<!--]--></h2></div><div class="process-team__body"><div class="process-team-member-grid"><!--[--><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(20vmin);--end-transform:translateY(-20vmin);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded process-team-member__image" alt="Elina" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Elīna Volkova</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Treatment Plan Coordinator</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">A graduate of Riga's “Victoria” Vocational Secondary School, Elīna specialises in customer service and administrative work. Parallel to her job at LAVA Dental Studio, she is studying for a Bachelor’s degree in International Marketing and Sales Management, improving her knowledge in the field of communication and management.&nbsp;</div></div></div><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(0);--end-transform:translateY(0);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded process-team-member__image" alt="Viktorija Griševa" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Viktorija Griševa</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Administrator, Treatment Plans Coordinator&nbsp;</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">At LAVA Dental Studio, Viktorija combines administrative duties with the role of treatment plan coordinator, helping patients to go through the entire treatment process step by step safely and confidently.&nbsp;
A balanced and internally strong personality, Viktorija remains calm in even the most difficult situations, invariably finding the most appropriate solution. She encourages patients and helps to coordinate the course of treatment in accordance with their wishes and means, ensuring that they have a well-planned and comfortable experience.&nbsp;</div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section class="section-feedback" id="feedback" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-feedback;"><div class="feedback-reviews u-bg-primary section-feedback__reviews"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="feedback-reviews__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Reviews<!--]--></h2></div><div class="feedback-reviews__body"><div class="feedback-reviews-box"><div class="feedback-reviews-box__content"><!--[--><div class="feedback-review-item" style=""><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>They use a modern and effective cleaning method,&nbsp;and my&nbsp;teeth&nbsp;now&nbsp;feel great.&nbsp;The option&nbsp;to choose additional services.&nbsp;I’d&nbsp;definitely recommend&nbsp;it!&nbsp;5/5 stars!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Eduards</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>I&nbsp;visited&nbsp;this dental clinic for professional oral hygiene and was&nbsp;extremely satisfied.&nbsp;The staff&nbsp;are&nbsp;kind and&nbsp;helpful, the atmosphere is calm and pleasant.&nbsp;The hygienist worked very carefully and gently, explaining&nbsp;the whole process,&nbsp;and&nbsp;giving&nbsp;useful tips for oral health.After the&nbsp;treatment,&nbsp;my teeth became clean and fresh. It was a&nbsp;great&nbsp;feeling!&nbsp;I’d definitely recommend this clinic to anyone who wants high-quality&nbsp;and&nbsp;professional care.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Jeļena Gžibovska</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>After my first visit to this clinic, I’m&nbsp;finally no&nbsp;longer&nbsp;scared of going to the dentist. Perfect!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Monta Mineiķe</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>I visited Lava Dental Studio for a comprehensive diagnosis –&nbsp;it was&nbsp;a very professional and pleasant experience!&nbsp;From the&nbsp;very&nbsp;first moment I felt that I was in good hands – the staff were&nbsp;kind, explained&nbsp;everything&nbsp;clearly&nbsp;to me, and the examination was carried out carefully and with modern equipment.</p><p>I’m now&nbsp;waiting for&nbsp;my&nbsp;next&nbsp;appointment, when&nbsp;I’ll receive a personalised treatment plan, but I can already say –&nbsp;the&nbsp;level of service&nbsp;is very high&nbsp;and&nbsp;I get the&nbsp;feeling that they really care about each patient.</p><p>I definitely recommend&nbsp;them&nbsp;to anybody&nbsp;seeking&nbsp;high-quality dental services in Riga!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Silvestrs Vaitkevics</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>I’m one of those people who WAS very&nbsp;scared&nbsp;of the dentist, because I have a panicky&nbsp;fear of needles and&nbsp;until now&nbsp;I’ve been fixing my teeth without anaesthesia for 19 years.&nbsp;An acquaintance&nbsp;recommended the Lava Dental Clinic to me.&nbsp;I researched it on the internet and&nbsp;concluded&nbsp;that I had to go for a consultation.&nbsp;When I&nbsp;got&nbsp;here, I&nbsp;received a very warm welcome.&nbsp;The girls on the staff are fantastic and very nice!&nbsp;Before&nbsp;my&nbsp;first&nbsp;appointment to correct&nbsp;my teeth,&nbsp;my insides were shaking, I felt as if&nbsp;I’d&nbsp;cry from fear, but before that I had to fill out a questionnaire with my wishes, where&nbsp;I&nbsp;mentioned that I’m paranoid about needles.&nbsp;I entered&nbsp;the office, lay down in fear and didn't even blink.&nbsp;But what surprised me was that, without my noticing, the dentist&nbsp;took the syringe and I didn't even feel that I was being injected.&nbsp;Of course,&nbsp;I shed a tear&nbsp;out&nbsp;of fear, but I&nbsp;needn’t have bothered, because&nbsp;there were no&nbsp;worries.&nbsp;I put on my headphones, choose my favourite Netflix series, and the&nbsp;dental treatment&nbsp;could&nbsp;begin!&nbsp;The best feeling, lying&nbsp;there for 2.5 hours,&nbsp;was that at some point you forget where you are, fall asleep,&nbsp;and&nbsp;at the same time you’re being taken care of with all the&nbsp;very latest&nbsp;modern innovations.&nbsp;The doctors do their job, I can even say, PERFECTLY, with care and love.&nbsp;Comparing&nbsp;my&nbsp;previous dental&nbsp;care&nbsp;and the appearance of&nbsp;my&nbsp;repaired teeth beforehand, the picture is&nbsp;akin to&nbsp;night and day!&nbsp;</p><p>I can definitely recommend this clinic and I’ll personally return here again and again whenever&nbsp;I need to&nbsp;in life.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Madara Freiberga</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The&nbsp;only dental clinic in my life that I’m&nbsp;happy to&nbsp;visit&nbsp;and spend money at!!&nbsp;[..]&nbsp;The&nbsp;staffare amazing!&nbsp;Incredibly nice people and professionals in their field!&nbsp;Words cannot describe it&nbsp;–&nbsp;you have to experience it, and I’m not afraid to recommend this dental clinic to anyone!&nbsp;</p><p>I wish you many productive years of work, dear Lava&nbsp;dental&nbsp;studio!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Dace Krūziņa</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The&nbsp;very&nbsp;best place to get your teeth cleaned, the service and&nbsp;welcome&nbsp;are top&nbsp;class. Thank you!!!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Kristīne Kažoka</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>A very calm and pleasant atmosphere.&nbsp;I felt&nbsp;as if I was&nbsp;in safe hands.&nbsp;Everything&nbsp;wasexplained&nbsp;to me,&nbsp;helping me&nbsp;to understand every detail of the treatment plan!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Lāsma Brenča</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Definitely the TOP clinic in Riga!!! I’d like to thank Dr. Vladislavs for&nbsp;a comprehensive&nbsp;visit, I’ll continue my treatment according to the&nbsp;prepared&nbsp;plan.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Deniss Rimavcevs</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>A friendly welcome upon arrival, which already&nbsp;leaves&nbsp;you feeling&nbsp;cared&nbsp;for.&nbsp;Punctual appointment, which you’re&nbsp;always reminded&nbsp;about, if possible, offers different times for maintenance (which I really like).&nbsp;The doctors are competent,&nbsp;advise you on the best treatment plan and recommend what’s suitable or not&nbsp;for me.&nbsp;My favourite part&nbsp;is the&nbsp;headphones&nbsp;–&nbsp;I don't have to listen to&nbsp;my teeth&nbsp;being fixed, I&nbsp;just&nbsp;watch "FRIENDS" and sometimes&nbsp;even&nbsp;forget where I am.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Toms Talle</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Wonderful&nbsp;service and&nbsp;fantastic&nbsp;specialists!&nbsp;Surgeon Miroslav extracted my&nbsp;wisdom teeth very quickly, skilfully and painlessly.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Dāvis Uļģis</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Very pleasant service and professional doctors!&nbsp;I can 100% recommend Dr. Miroslav,&nbsp;mywisdom teeth surgery was very successful, painless&nbsp;with a fast&nbsp;rehabilitation process.&nbsp;Every&nbsp;visit&nbsp;I&nbsp;make&nbsp;is&nbsp;easy&nbsp;and stress-free.&nbsp;Thank you!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Evelina Avlasina</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Entering LAVA, the atmosphere was&nbsp;hard to put into words.&nbsp;From the smell, to the interior and the staff.&nbsp;I’d like to say a special thank you to hygienist Diāna Zamarina for&nbsp;her wonderful&nbsp;communication, and&nbsp;for doing an&nbsp;even better job!&nbsp;I’ll definitely&nbsp;return&nbsp;and recommend it!!!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Elina Vasiljeva</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Very good dentists,&nbsp;who&nbsp;explain everything. No&nbsp;pain, no fear, everything’s comfortable and convenient, so much so that I could fall asleep in the dentist's chair!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Vitālijs Meija</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Extremely&nbsp;kind and pleasant service, friendly staff.&nbsp;Result and atmosphere 10/10,&nbsp;delighted&nbsp;to&nbsp;make return visits.&nbsp;Highly recommended!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Veronika Šteņa</div></div><!--]--></div><div class="feedback-reviews-box__footer"><div class="carousel-autoplay carousel-autoplay--paused" style="--autoplay-item-duration:5000ms;"><button class="carousel-autoplay__button" aria-label="Play carousel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><g><path fill="currentColor" d="M16 14.741a1 1 0 0 1 1.504-.864l9.015 5.26a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.727l-9.015 5.259A1 1 0 0 1 16 25.259z"></path></g></svg></button><div class="carousel-autoplay__dots"><!--[--><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot--active carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 1"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 2"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 3"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 4"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 5"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 6"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 7"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 8"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 9"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 10"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 11"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 12"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 13"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 14"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 15"></button><!--]--></div></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="feedback-instagram u-bg-primary section-feedback__instagram"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="feedback-instagram__header"><h2 class="section-titl