<section class="section-about-us" id="about-us" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-about-us;"><div class="about-manifest u-bg-secondary"><div class="about-manifest__bg"><img width="1440" height="980" data-nuxt-img="" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 100vw, (max-width: 1349px) 100vw, 1440px" srcset="/assets/img/3c76d766f5f4-foil-bg.avif 320w, /assets/img/4a915424ad55-foil-bg.avif 640w, /assets/img/8a64e80eb008-foil-bg.avif 1280w, /assets/img/52d2150f30d2-foil-bg.avif 1440w, /assets/img/0aba37dd0265-foil-bg.avif 2560w, /assets/img/8f8b2e68ba96-foil-bg.avif 2880w" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="about-manifest__bg-layer" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/8f8b2e68ba96-foil-bg.avif"><img width="1440" height="980" data-nuxt-img="" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 100vw, (max-width: 1349px) 100vw, 1440px" srcset="/assets/img/3c76d766f5f4-foil-bg.avif 320w, /assets/img/4a915424ad55-foil-bg.avif 640w, /assets/img/8a64e80eb008-foil-bg.avif 1280w, /assets/img/52d2150f30d2-foil-bg.avif 1440w, /assets/img/0aba37dd0265-foil-bg.avif 2560w, /assets/img/8f8b2e68ba96-foil-bg.avif 2880w" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="about-manifest__bg-layer" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/8f8b2e68ba96-foil-bg.avif"></div><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="image-info-box"><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--aside"><!--[--><div class="image-carousel"><div class="image-carousel__container"><!--[--><img src="/assets/img/e3547a40fe22-01.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style=""><img src="/assets/img/29eb5e829311-02.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/c78fd0d7334c-03.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/7d7b6edefa96-04.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/e05ca2873721-05.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/c5dac772c117-06.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><!--]--></div><div class="carousel-autoplay carousel-autoplay--paused image-carousel__controls" style="--autoplay-item-duration:5000ms;"><button class="carousel-autoplay__button" aria-label="Play carousel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><g><path fill="currentColor" d="M16 14.741a1 1 0 0 1 1.504-.864l9.015 5.26a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.727l-9.015 5.259A1 1 0 0 1 16 25.259z"></path></g></svg></button><div class="carousel-autoplay__dots"><!--[--><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot--active carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 1"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 2"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 3"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 4"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 5"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 6"></button><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">In our care, you’ll receive not only treatment and a perfect smile, but also care, openness and support all the way to the result. Our mission is to change the perception of dentistry. </p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><p>Music, ambiance and a finely designed interior together with a specially tailored atmosphere will enable you to experience a completely different dentistry — one that is comfortable, calm and inspiring.</p>
<p>We want your experience with us to be like flying in first class — personal, convenient and with no worries or stress.</p>
</div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--footer"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section id="faq" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-faq;"><div class="faq u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="faq__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">Before you start, you might want to know more.</h2></div><div class="faq__body"><div class="faq-categories"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style="display:none;"><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title"></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">How quickly can veneers be made?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Veneers can be made and installed in as little as 7 days, provided that all teeth are healthy. </p><p><br></p><p>However, it is necessary to take into account both the number of veneers required and the ability to schedule visits to the doctor. In practice, a full improvement of the dental row with veneers will take from 4-6 weeks, or 4 visits. </p><ul class="list-bullet"><li class="" style="" value="1">In the first visit, we discuss what you want and conduct various examinations, based on which we will be able to plan the shape, colour and required number of veneers. </li><li class="" style="" value="2">In the second visit, we present both the digital smile design so that you can preview your new smile digitally before we perform any manipulations, as well as the full treatment plan with all costs and possible timeframes. </li><li class="" style="" value="3">The third visit involves preparation for the placement of veneers, during which the teeth will be slightly polished (not ground). </li><li class="" style="" value="4">The fourth visit consists of placing the veneers. </li></ul><p>*Veneers are handmade, so the preparation time depends on the number of veneers you need!</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Can only one tooth be improved with a veneer?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Yes, of course. If a tooth has darkened or has been traumatized, we can place a veneer on just one tooth to match the rest of your smile.</p><p><br></p><p>In fact, it's quite common that just a couple of veneers are all it takes to completely transform your smile, giving you a wonderful boost of confidence!</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">How much does one veneer cost?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>One veneer costs starting from €800. The cost depends on the individual clinical case and patient preferences.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></section>
<section id="contacts" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-contacts;"><div class="contacts u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="contacts__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">We are right here. </h2></div><div class="contacts__body"><div class="image-info-box"><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--aside"><!--[--><img width="740" height="627" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/1de9caf9aa9f-map.svg 1x, /assets/img/dd2271325196-map.svg 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image-info-box__image" alt="Map" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/1de9caf9aa9f-map.svg"><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">Conveniently located to make your appointment even easier. With easy access for people with mobility impairments. </p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><p>Our studio is located at Ausekļa Street 14, where there are parking spaces in Zone B. We will pay for your parking while you are at LAVA dental.</p>
</div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div></div><div class="contacts__footer"><img width="1290" height="590" data-nuxt-img="" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 100vw, (max-width: 1349px) 100vw, 1290px" srcset="/assets/img/6be9b9a04821-location.avif 320w, /assets/img/936863dc2c1a-location.avif 640w, /assets/img/9f7348037191-location.avif 1280w, /assets/img/99bea6f7b10f-location.avif 1290w, /assets/img/4bbb139df2cb-location.avif 2560w, /assets/img/b86bd4d1f5a0-location.avif 2580w" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image" alt="LAVA Dental Studio" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/b86bd4d1f5a0-location.avif"></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></main>
